{"title":"Briar Warden","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 46 Briar that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">corrode</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">crush</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">freeze</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 3 times (1.6% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/briar-warden\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/briar-warden?lv=45\">Lv 45 <span>40</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/briar-warden?lv=46\">Lv 46 <span>35</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/briar-warden?lv=47\">Lv 47 <span>5</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/briar-warden?lv=48\">Lv 48 <span>2</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/briar-warden?lv=45\" title=\"Pick level 45\"><td><b>45</b></td><td>243</td><td>29.3</td><td>2,250</td><td class=\"muted\">729 · 41 · 6,750</td><td>40</td><td>in the wilds around 1481, 1453</td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/briar-warden\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>46</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>254</td><td>29.8